15:29.177 --> 15:30.584
But I guess anyone can.

15:30.653 --> 15:32.996
Of course you can hit a girl in the face.

15:33.064 --> 15:34.740
They have faces, don't they?

15:34.808 --> 15:36.984
Are-are you talkin' to me, robert mitchum?

15:37.053 --> 15:40.805
You bet your ass I am.
Look at you, you're pathetic.

15:40.872 --> 15:43.284
What kind of a man gets fired by a broad?

15:43.352 --> 15:46.131
A man with a female boss? Don't crack wise.

15:46.201 --> 15:49.215
Listen, peter, somewhere along the line,
you got turned around.

15:49.282 --> 15:50.521
You're a man.

15:50.590 --> 15:52.498
And whaddaya think it means to be a man?

15:52.566 --> 15:55.178
Um, it means not gettin' pushed around.

15:55.246 --> 15:57.055
Exactly. It means drinkin'...

15:57.122 --> 15:59.500
Not because I want to,
but because I need to.

15:59.568 --> 16:01.343
Right! It means standing up to fart,

16:01.411 --> 16:03.020
Not hidin' it in a pillow,

16:03.088 --> 16:04.558
Or holdin' it in till your stomach goes...

16:04.625 --> 16:08.480
Now you've got it!

16:08.547 --> 16:10.190
Gimme my keys, horace!

16:10.257 --> 16:11.997
I'm going to see my boss!

16:12.066 --> 16:14.041
But, peter, you're drunk!

16:14.109 --> 16:16.119
Horace?

16:16.187 --> 16:18.129
You're right. This is more important.

16:18.198 --> 16:23.760
Angela!

16:23.827 --> 16:27.076
Open up in there!

16:31.934 --> 16:33.778
Oh, my god!

16:40.513 --> 16:41.651
Angela!

16:41.718 --> 16:46.944
Angela, wake up! What the-- griffin?

16:47.013 --> 16:49.557
Angela, what the hell are you
doin' tryin' to kill yourself?

16:49.626 --> 16:52.406
Oh, why the hell did you
pull me out of there?

16:52.475 --> 16:54.383
You shoulda just left me alone!

16:54.452 --> 16:56.461
That's how I'm gonna end up, anyway.

16:56.528 --> 16:59.108
What are you talkin' about?
I'm talking about the fact...

16:59.175 --> 17:00.884
That I have nothing to live for.

17:00.952 --> 17:02.492
Sure, you do.

17:02.560 --> 17:05.340
Someday, a white man's gonna
be elected president again.

17:05.408 --> 17:08.858
Griffin, I haven't been
with anyone in ten years.

17:08.926 --> 17:10.768
And when you spurned my advances,

17:10.836 --> 17:12.445
It was a wakeup call.

17:12.511 --> 17:14.689
No one's ever gonna love me again.

17:14.757 --> 17:16.329
Wait a minute.

17:16.397 --> 17:19.044
So that's why you been actin'
like such a wacky ass around me?

17:19.111 --> 17:21.892
It's been so long since
I've been with a man,

17:21.960 --> 17:24.203
I don't even remember what it feels like.

17:24.272 --> 17:26.214
I always imagined it felt very painful.

17:26.282 --> 17:28.626
You just sorta grit your teeth
and let us do what we want.

17:28.694 --> 17:32.380
I just wish one person was
able to find me attractive.

17:32.447 --> 17:37.406
That's not too much to ask, is it? - No...

17:37.473 --> 17:40.253
Look, angela, I came
over here to punch you...

17:40.321 --> 17:41.928
And maybe kick you in the boob.

17:41.997 --> 17:43.570
But now I'm all turned around.

17:43.637 --> 17:44.943
Angela?

17:45.011 --> 17:45.881
Angela?! Right here.

17:47.089 --> 17:49.266
But now all I want to do is help you out.

17:49.336 --> 17:51.275
I'll tell you what, you know that ritzy,

17:51.344 --> 17:52.918
Upscale place over on third?

17:52.986 --> 17:54.526
The stuffy fella? That's it.

17:54.594 --> 17:57.541
You be at the stuffy fella
tonight around 9:00.

17:57.610 --> 18:00.893
I think I know someone who
might be perfect for you.

18:09.236 --> 18:11.849
<i>Mmm, well, hello.</i>

18:11.917 --> 18:13.156
Good evening, sir.

18:13.224 --> 18:16.072
I am reginald new york
knickerbocker, millionaire.

18:17.245 --> 18:18.987
Are you serving fish this evening?

18:19.054 --> 18:20.192
No, sir.

18:20.260 --> 18:22.236
Then I believe my guest has arrived.

18:22.304 --> 18:27.162
There she is! You must be angela.

18:27.230 --> 18:29.306
Hi, are you peter's friend, reginald?

18:29.373 --> 18:31.251
Mmm, indeed I am.

18:33.763 --> 18:37.415
Mmm, what a beautiful shade
of lipstick on those teeth.

18:37.483 --> 18:39.860
Oh, thank you, but that's
just my gums bleeding...

18:39.928 --> 18:41.938
From aggressive gingivitis.

18:42.006 --> 18:44.550
Mmm, well, your mouth is too sweet...

18:44.618 --> 18:46.327
For your teeth to want to stay in.

18:46.395 --> 18:48.338
Oh. Yes.

18:48.406 --> 18:50.213
Well, I-I'm just gonna
go to the powder room...

18:50.281 --> 18:52.191
And freshen up.

18:52.259 --> 18:53.900
She's eatin' it up.

18:53.968 --> 18:56.880
This is easier than an american
finding his brother in china.

18:56.948 --> 18:58.556
Ron?

18:58.624 --> 19:00.232
Ron, where are you?

19:00.301 --> 19:01.472
Over here, paul!

19:01.540 --> 19:02.780
Oh, good, there you are.

19:02.848 --> 19:04.086
It's pretty here.

19:04.154 --> 19:05.291
Yes, it is.

19:10.820 --> 19:13.066
Mmm, what a wonderful dinner.

19:13.133 --> 19:14.673
Would you like some dessert?

19:14.741 --> 19:17.689
Did you bake a pie? Well, there is a pie.

19:17.757 --> 19:20.002
It's been baking since I met you.

19:20.070 --> 19:22.849
Mmm, gross. What?Nothing.

19:22.916 --> 19:25.663
You know, angela, there's
something I need to tell you.

19:25.731 --> 19:28.545
My doctor has given me 24 hours to live.

19:28.613 --> 19:29.953
Oh, my god!

19:30.021 --> 19:31.359
No, no, it's quite all right.

19:31.426 --> 19:35.245
Because I vowed to myself That I would
spend the last night of my life...

19:35.314 --> 19:38.262
In the company of the most
beautiful woman in the world.

19:38.330 --> 19:40.641
And that's just what I have done.

19:40.710 --> 19:44.159
Oh, reginald. No, no, no.

19:44.227 --> 19:46.638
This is already a perfect
end to a perfect evening.

19:46.706 --> 19:49.453
Good night, my dear. Reginald...

19:49.520 --> 19:51.663
I want you to make love to me.

19:51.731 --> 19:53.374
Oh, if only I could,

19:53.441 --> 19:56.254
But I must to a jew to
put my affairs in order.

19:56.322 --> 19:58.598
I know what's going on here.

19:58.666 --> 20:00.208
You don't want to be with me.

20:00.275 --> 20:01.615
You're just like everybody else.

20:01.684 --> 20:03.023
So-so go, then.

20:03.091 --> 20:05.770
I'm just gonna stay here and kill myself.

20:05.839 --> 20:08.083
But you can't kill yourself...

20:08.150 --> 20:09.690
Every time somebody won't sleep with you.

20:09.759 --> 20:10.929
I won't.

20:10.998 --> 20:12.772
Just sleep with me just this once,

20:12.840 --> 20:14.717
And it'll give me everything I need.

20:14.785 --> 20:16.224
Sleep with me tonight.

20:16.291 --> 20:18.168
Save my life.

20:23.058 --> 20:25.740
Oh, that was fantastic!

20:25.809 --> 20:27.784
It was exactly what I needed.

20:27.852 --> 20:31.066
Mmm, well, hopefully there'll
be no more talk of suicide.

20:31.134 --> 20:34.486
Oh, no. I feel better
than I've felt in years.

20:34.553 --> 20:36.596
I have my confidence again.

20:36.663 --> 20:39.645
I'm ready to go back out
there and meet someone.

20:39.713 --> 20:41.655
Well, I'm glad to be of service.

20:41.723 --> 20:44.068
Oh, just one more thing before you go.

20:44.136 --> 20:45.542
What's that, my dear?

20:45.609 --> 20:47.852
See you at work on Monday, griffin.

20:47.920 --> 20:50.033
Huh? Oh, I'm gonna have to have a word...

20:50.100 --> 20:52.680
With rite-aid about this fake moustache.

20:55.695 --> 20:58.240
Well, I got my job back,
angela's happy again,

20:58.309 --> 21:00.285
And she's not gonna harass me anymore.

21:00.353 --> 21:01.759
Everything worked out perfect.

21:01.827 --> 21:02.999
Not really, peter.

21:03.066 --> 21:04.474
Yeah, you cheated on your wife.

21:04.541 --> 21:06.383
No, I didn't. I used mort.

21:06.452 --> 21:08.257
Oh, my god, I forgot about mort!

21:09.500 --> 21:11.375
I want my two dollars!

21:11.376 --> 22:12.376
Thank you for watching «Family Guy» on
www.FOX-fan.ru